<view class="page live-page"><brand-header title="同一案例连续联动"/><view class="content"><view class="card"><text class="title">从一个视频开始，连续办理到财务收尾</text><text>只在首次开始时建立空白模拟环境。后续切换岗位保留全部业务数据；每一步需要在实际业务页面办理。</text><text class="muted">视频、AI、发布回执、附件与银行事实使用本地模拟输入。本页读取当前进度，不载入阶段结果。原数据已备份，可在结束时恢复。</text><text wx:if="active">当前：{{actor}}</text><text wx:if="error" class="error">{{error}}</text><button wx:if="!active" class="solid begin-live" bindtap="begin">开始空白连续案例</button></view><view wx:if="active" class="card"><text class="title">切换办理人</text><button wx:for="{{actors}}" wx:key="id" class="outline switch-live {{item.selected?'selected':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="switchActor">{{item.organization}} · {{item.name}} ›</button></view><view wx:if="active" class="card"><text class="title">本案例实时记录</text><view wx:for="{{stages}}" wx:key="title" class="record"><text>{{item.title}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.value}}</text><button wx:if="item.url" class="outline live-record" data-url="{{item.url}}" data-actor="{{item.actorId}}" bindtap="open">{{item.actorId?'切换对应财务并查看原记录':'查看原记录'}} ›</button></view><text class="muted">记录入口仍按当前岗位检查权限；可先切换到对应办理人。</text></view></view><view wx:if="active" class="page-actions"><button class="solid restore-live" bindtap="restore">结束连续案例并恢复原数据</button></view></view>
